DELETE /repos/{owner}/{repo}/keys/{key_id}
Deploy keys are immutable. If you need to update a key, remove the key and create a new one instead.
Required: owner (path) — The account owner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.; repo (path) — The name of the repository without the `.git` extension. The name is not case sensitive.; key_id (path) — The unique identifier of the key.

